# Build-time (Vite): required for static hosting (Netlify, Vercel, S3, etc.) where
# there is no /api on the same host. Point this at your API server (e.g. Render).
#
# You can use the origin only; /api is added automatically if the path is empty:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-app.onrender.com
# Or include /api explicitly:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-app.onrender.com/api
#
# Netlify: Site settings → Environment variables → VITE_API_BASE_URL → redeploy
#
# Local dev: leave unset; Vite proxies /api to the backend
